# Runtime state: FHE key material, committee shares, credential store.
# Committing these would hand a reader the ability to decrypt every enrolled
# template. `npm run vectors` and `npm run bench` regenerate the files that
# DO belong in the repository.
.data/
*.local

# Local-only session tracker. Never commit: it contains machine-specific
# state, operator notes, and pre-sign-off security observations.
MILESTONES.md

